{"id":"salary-budget-vs-paid","title":"General Fund salaries against the adopted budget: Sheriff, Police, Fire and Public Health","question":"Did the Sheriff's General Fund salary spending run over its adopted budget only in the year the Board was told about, or most years?","finding":"The Sheriff's General Fund salaries ran over the adopted budget in 7 of 8 years from fiscal 2019 to 2026: $173.4 million against $156.5 million in fiscal 2024 ($16.9 million over), and $202.7 million against $188.9 million in fiscal 2026. Over the eight years its overtime ran $143.0 million over budget while permanent salaries came in $80.3 million under; for Police the figures are $391.0 million and $270.1 million.","how":"Character Salaries, fund type General Fund, adopted budget against the ledger, by fiscal year. The overtime and permanent-salary split uses all funds.","limits":"The adopted budget leaves out supplemental appropriations (for the Sheriff in fiscal 2024, Board file 24-0609) and transfers between a department's own accounts; the ledger shows what was spent, not whether the spending was later authorised. Fringe benefits are not included.","tier":"REDFLAG","columns":[{"k":"department","t":"Department","type":"org"},{"k":"year","t":"Fiscal year","type":"year"},{"k":"budget","t":"Adopted budget","type":"usd"},{"k":"paid","t":"Spent (ledger)","type":"usd"},{"k":"over","t":"Over (under) budget","type":"usd"},{"k":"pct","t":"Over budget","type":"pct"}],"rows":[{"department":"FIR Fire Department","year":2022,"budget":271272582,"paid":322457670,"over":51185088,"pct":0.189},{"department":"SHF Sheriff","year":2022,"budget":137939929,"paid":157611809,"over":19671880,"pct":0.143},{"department":"SHF Sheriff","year":2021,"budget":129400130,"paid":147125394,"over":17725264,"pct":0.137},{"department":"FIR Fire Department","year":2021,"budget":255544932,"paid":287475572,"over":31930640,"pct":0.125},{"department":"SHF Sheriff","year":2024,"budget":156471082,"paid":173352456,"over":16881